  "image": "/images/posts/11659.webp",
  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Usuarias del Programa Mujeres Jefas de Hogar participaron en una capacitación junto a la Clínica Dental Sonrie Sano, orientada al cuidado y prevención de enfermedades de la cavidad bucal.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🪥\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tad/1/16/1faa5.png\"/> Durante la jornada se abordaron temas como:</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Prevención del cáncer oral.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Cuidado frente a caries y enfermedades frecuentes.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Hábitos para mantener una buena salud dental.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"👩‍👩‍👧‍👦\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t3a/1/16/1f469_200d_1f469_200d_1f467_200d_1f466.png\"/> Desde la Clínica Dental Sonrie Sano, destacó el importante rol de las jefas de hogar como promotoras de estos conocimientos, transmitiendo recomendaciones de cuidado a sus familias.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🤝\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t64/1/16/1f91d.png\"/> Seguimos fortaleciendo espacios de información, prevención y bienestar para las mujeres de nuestra comuna.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/maull%C3%ADn?__cft__[0]=AZZngEt1qz6T_owtHFxfj9doL_3hzGfZ_Kfs9JoHK1xT-CTZYzHr-O4DA_1CdAdaKdcyK-6MQIKHfSNLLfbBSRnHr6SE6ZOFDEAfAfRXVrnUkW8pDwKeqT_CJxyvF3H22a1OKEd4oCIkg1aSAcmaKVCL&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#Maullín</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/mujeresjefasdehogar?__cft__[0]=AZZngEt1qz6T_owtHFxfj9doL_3hzGfZ_Kfs9JoHK1xT-CTZYzHr-O4DA_1CdAdaKdcyK-6MQIKHfSNLLfbBSRnHr6SE6ZOFDEAfAfRXVrnUkW8pDwKeqT_CJxyvF3H22a1OKEd4oCIkg1aSAcmaKVCL&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#MujeresJefasDeHogar</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/saludoral?__cft__[0]=AZZngEt1qz6T_owtHFxfj9doL_3hzGfZ_Kfs9JoHK1xT-CTZYzHr-O4DA_1CdAdaKdcyK-6MQIKHfSNLLfbBSRnHr6SE6ZOFDEAfAfRXVrnUkW8pDwKeqT_CJxyvF3H22a1OKEd4oCIkg1aSAcmaKVCL&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#SaludOral</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/sonriesano?__cft__[0]=AZZngEt1qz6T_owtHFxfj9doL_3hzGfZ_Kfs9JoHK1xT-CTZYzHr-O4DA_1CdAdaKdcyK-6MQIKHfSNLLfbBSRnHr6SE6ZOFDEAfAfRXVrnUkW8pDwKeqT_CJxyvF3H22a1OKEd4oCIkg1aSAcmaKVCL&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#SonrieSano</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/prevenci%C3%B3n?__cft__[0]=AZZngEt1qz6T_owtHFxfj9doL_3hzGfZ_Kfs9JoHK1xT-CTZYzHr-O4DA_1CdAdaKdcyK-6MQIKHfSNLLfbBSRnHr6SE6ZOFDEAfAfRXVrnUkW8pDwKeqT_CJxyvF3H22a1OKEd4oCIkg1aSAcmaKVCL&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#Prevención</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente comunicaciones munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-74 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-